  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for stronger and sustainable municipalities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving governance at local level in Kosovo&#x2019;s 38 municipalities. This goal will be achieved through a set of interventions aiming at increasing competence and capacity, advice on necessary legal improvements and increased interactions between different levels of government. The overriding objective of the project is to contribute to local authorities  becoming robust and well-functioning entities.</narrative>
  </description>
